# PIVOTREADY needs NO environment variables to run.
# The full journey (assessment, career map, three paths, challenges, plan,
# paywall with judge demo preview) works with zero credentials: all state is
# stored in the visitor's browser (localStorage).
#
# Optional integrations (Supabase persistence, Stripe test-mode checkout,
# LLM explanations) are NOT implemented in this version, so no keys are read.
# Never commit real secrets. Use .env.local (git-ignored) or your host's
# environment settings.
